  - Nifen Art (Regular and Bold) -- the pixel typeface the application uses
    for its interface text. Original to this project except the hiragana,
    which are adapted from Ark Pixel Font 12 px (version 2026.09.25;
    Copyright (c) 2021, TakWolf, https://takwolf.com; licensed under the SIL
    Open Font License, Version 1.1, with no Reserved Font Name). Copyright
    2026 JuanGSanchez; licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
    (https://openfontlicense.org), with the Reserved Font Name "Nifen Art".
    The licence text ships in pixelart_creator/fonts/OFL.txt, beside the
    font files and their change log (pixelart_creator/fonts/FONTLOG.txt).

  - Nifen Art CJK JP, Nifen Art CJK SC and Nifen Art CJK KR (each in Regular
    and Bold) -- the second face of the same pixel typeface, which the
    application uses for the Han characters and the Hangul syllables that
    Nifen Art does not hold. Every character is an original drawing made for
    this project, or is composed of such drawings; no third-party design is
    included. Copyright 2026 JuanGSanchez; licensed under the SIL Open Font
    License, Version 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org), with the Reserved Font
